  <video class="gifv" muted loop playsinline controls preload="none" poster="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation/images/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation-17.webp" width="896" height="512" aria-label="a young male person with silver hair standing on the beach, in the style of sandara tang, piratepunk, karol bak, video, white and amber, hiroshi nagai, enchanting — ar 128:71" data-gifv>
    <source src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation/images/midjourney-runway-gen2-animation-17.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <figcaption>a young male person with silver hair standing on the beach, in the style of sandara tang, piratepunk, karol bak, video, white and amber, hiroshi nagai, enchanting — ar 128:71</figcaption>
